Interpreter CUA fork

This repository is an Interpreter-maintained fork of Cua:
https://github.com/trycua/cua

The upstream Git history is retained. Cua is distributed under the MIT License;
the upstream Cua AI, Inc. copyright and license text are preserved in
LICENSE.md.

Interpreter-specific maintenance currently focuses on the native computer-use
driver used by Interpreter Workstation, particularly libs/cua-driver and its
Rust implementation. Other upstream packages and documentation remain in the
fork to support history-preserving upstream synchronization unless explicitly
documented otherwise.

This fork does not by itself provide, endorse, or claim compatibility with Cua
AI hosted services. References to cua.ai, TryCua packages, or upstream release
infrastructure describe the upstream project unless an Interpreter document
explicitly says otherwise.
